          "motion": "../assets/images/exhibits/odyssey/3e8c3681-ff60-4a3f-9b1c-d37b5635d397.webp",
          "storyZh": "十年围城终于落幕。特洛伊的火光还在燃烧，奥德修斯却已望向大海——归乡比战争更远，也更难。",
          "storyEn": "The ten-year siege is over. Troy still burns, but Odysseus already looks to the sea: the way home will be longer, and harder, than the war."
